WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Valve cotters / keepers
What it does: Lock the retainer to the stem so the spring can close the valve.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Valve cotters / keepers
How it works: The retainer presses them into its tapered seat.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Valve cotters / keepers
How it moves: Travel with the valve and retainer; do not separate during operation.
